1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,514
Benin's toughest soldiers
were not men.

2
00:00:03,275 --> 00:00:04,530
They were the Agojie,

3
00:00:04,531 --> 00:00:07,039
women who fought for
the kings of Dahomey.

4
00:00:07,631 --> 00:00:10,173
At their peak, they made up
about a third of the army.

5
00:00:10,798 --> 00:00:14,305
In 1892, France sent the
Foreign Legion against them.

6
00:00:14,944 --> 00:00:16,918
They fought to the end,
at the battle of Cana.

7
00:00:17,937 --> 00:00:20,116
The last known survivor, Nawi,

8
00:00:20,117 --> 00:00:22,223
is said to have died in 1979.

9
00:00:22,803 --> 00:00:25,261
So why does almost nobody
know their name?

